<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="my">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Happy Birthday, My Love! 💖</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffe6eb 0%, #ffc3d0 100%);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      padding: 20px 15px 50px 15px;
      position: relative;
    }

    /* Falling Hearts & Flowers Animation */
    .heart-fall {
      position: fixed;
      top: -10%;
      font-size: 20px;
      user-select: none;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 9999;
      animation: fall linear infinite;
    }
    @keyframes fall {
      0% {
        transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
        opacity: 1;
      }
      100% {
        transform: translateY(110vh) rotate(360deg);
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 420px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    /* Header & Flower Decoration */
    .header-flower {
      font-size: 40px;
      animation: pulse 2s infinite ease-in-out;
    }
    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
      50% { transform: scale(1.15); }
    }

    h1 {
      color: #d6336c;
      font-size: 26px;
      margin: 10px 0 5px 0;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    .subtitle {
      color: #862e9c;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-style: italic;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    /* Photo Cards Section */
    .gallery {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }
    .photo-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(214, 51, 108, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
      transform: rotate(0deg);
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }
    .photo-card:nth-child(even) {
      transform: rotate(-2deg);
    }
    .photo-card:nth-child(odd) {
      transform: rotate(2deg);
    }
    .photo-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 250px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .photo-note {
      margin-top: 8px;
      color: #a61e4d;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* Interactive Surprise Button */
    .surprise-btn {
      background: linear-gradient(45deg, #ff4757, #ff6b81);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 15px 32px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(255, 71, 87, 0.4);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.2s;
      margin: 10px 0;
    }
    .surprise-btn:active {
      transform: scale(0.95);
    }

    /* Hidden Note Box */
    #love-letter {
      display: none;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      border: 2px dashed #ff85a1;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      animation: fadeIn 1s ease-in-out;
    }
    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    #love-letter p {
      color: #4a4a4a;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="header-flower">🌸🌸🌸</div>
    <h1>Happy Birthday, My Love! 💖</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">for my lovely girlfriend ❤️❤️❤️❤️</p>

    <!-- Photo Gallery & Love Notes -->
    <div class="gallery">
      <div class="photo-card">
        <img src="IMG_0547.jpeg" alt="Moment 1">
        <p class="photo-note">✨ နောင်နဲ့့အတူရှိတဲ့ အချိန်တိုင်းက ပီအတွက် အပျော်ဆုံးအချိနိပဲ...</p>
      </div>

      <div class="photo-card">
        <img src="IMG_0548.jpeg" alt="Moment 2">
        <p class="photo-note">🌹 ဘာတွေလုပ်ပေးမယ်ဆိုပီး ကတိတွေအများကြီးမပေးနိုင်ပေမဲ့ ပီရဲ့ရှိသမျှအရာအားလုံးကနောင့်အတွက်ပါပဲ...</p>
      </div>

      <div class="photo-card">
        <img src="IMG_0549.jpeg" alt="Moment 3">
        <p class="photo-note">🤍 အမြဲတမ်း လက်တွဲထားချင်တယ်...</p>
      </div>

      <div class="photo-card">
        <img src="IMG_0550.jpeg" alt="Moment 4">
        <p class="photo-note">🎁 နောင်နဲ့တွေ့ရတာ ပီဘဝရဲ့ အကောင်းဆုံးဆုလာဘ်ပဲ...</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Surprise Button -->
    <button class="surprise-btn" onclick="openLetter()">နှိပ်ကြည့်ပါ ✨🌸</button>

    <!-- Love Letter Box -->
    <div id="love-letter">
      <p style="font-weight: bold; color: #ff3366; font-size: 17px;">
        🎂 ပျော်ရွှင်စရာ မွေးနေ့ဖြစ်ပါစေနော်! 💖
      </p>
      <p>
        ဒီနေ့ထက်မက ရှေ့ဆက်မယ့် မွေးနေ့ပေါင်းများစွာမှာလည်း အချစ်ဘေးကလေးရဲ့ဘေးမှာ အမြဲရှိနေပေးမယ်နော်
        လိုရာဆန္ဒတွေ အကုန်ပြည့်ဝပြီး အမြဲတမ်း ပြုံးပျော်နိုင်ပါစေနော်! 🎈🎁🌸
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Heart and Flower Falling Effect on Load
    function createHearts() {
      const symbols = ['💖', '💕', '🌸', '✨', '🌹', '❤️'];
      const count = 30; // အသည်း / ပန်းပွင့် အရေအတွက်

      for (let i = 0; i = count; i++) {
        const heart = document.createElement('div');
        heart.classList.add('heart-fall');
        heart.innerText = symbols[Math.floor(Math.random() * symbols.length)];
        heart.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + 'vw';
        heart.style.animationDuration = (Math.random() * 3 + 2) + 's'; // 2s to 5s
        heart.style.animationDelay = Math.random() * 2 + 's';
        heart.style.fontSize = (Math.random() * 15 + 15) + 'px';
        document.body.appendChild(heart);
      }
    }

    // Trigger Heart Animation on Page Load
    window.onload = createHearts;

    // Show Surprise Letter
    function openLetter() {
      document.getElementById('love-letter').style.display = 'block';
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
